---
source: tools/junius/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout
---
Validate manifests against the schema and semantic rules

Usage: junius check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>      Output format for command results [default: plain] [possible values: plain, json]
      --manifest <MANIFEST>  Validate a single manifest at this path
      --plugin <PLUGIN>      Validate the manifest at plugins/<NAME>/plugin.toml
  -v, --verbose...           Increase verbosity (repeat for more)
      --base <BASE>          Git ref to diff against for breaking-change detection (`SQL.EXPOSED.NO_BREAKING`). No-op outside a git repo or if the ref is unresolvable. CI typically passes `origin/main` [default: main]
      --cwd <CWD>            Run as if junius were started in <CWD>
  -h, --help                 Print help
